	quest.006E89C9EC0D0F18.quest_desc: [
		"A letter arrives with no sender and a wax seal you do not recognise."
		""
		"\"The old guardians are stirring. The sun-priests are restless, the frost sleeps lightly, and the iron watcher has begun to walk. Where they wake, the wyrms follow. Gather your strength. Ask the bestiary. -- A friend\""
		""
		"Read the letter, then prepare for the road."
	]
	quest.006E89C9EC0D0F18.title: "Prologue: The Sealed Letter"
